(1) Every licence shall be subject to the following conditionspremises except on the premises specified in the licence;

(b) the TYRO system in respect of which the licence is issued shall not be operated for the purpose of telecommunication or transmitting broadcast matter;

(c) the licence shall, in accordance with any written law, obtain such permits, licences or other authorisation from other public authorities as may be necessary for or in connection with the lawful installation or operation of the TYRO system.

(2) Without prejudice to sub-regulation (1), the Minister may impose such additional conditions as he thinks fit. Operating a TVRO system.
